{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_03769","headline":"和韦承庆过义阳公主山池五首 四 · 杜审言","name":"和韦承庆过义阳公主山池五首 四","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"攒石当轩倚，悬泉度牖飞。\n鹿麛冲妓席，鹤子曳童衣。\n园果尝难遍，池莲摘未稀。\n卷帘唯待月，应在醉中归。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"杜审言","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_03769.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_03769","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}